<Policy slug="datum" updated="24 June 2026">
  <p>Datum does not collect, store, or transmit any personal data. It has no analytics, no advertising, and no third-party SDKs. It does not require an account.</p>
  <p>Datum reads and writes audio metadata only in the files you explicitly open, and only saves when you choose to.</p>
  <p>If you have questions, write in through the <a href="/contact/?about=datum">contact form</a>.</p>
</Policy>
